<p>Using the steam of your generators you shape it into a psionic fog that lasts <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns. Any foes caught inside will take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">44, 59, 70, 80, 89</acronym> damage per turn and be seared, reducing their fire resistance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 16%, 21%, 26%, 30%</acronym> and and mind save by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 16, 21, 26, 30.</acronym></p><p>The damage will increase with your Mindpower.</p>